        "evidence_text": "of the academic year, from September to June. Its amount is reduced during months spent abroad (compulsory international mobility, delocalized master’s programs) or during internships undertaken outside of Université Paris-Saclay affiliated labs.<br>A yearly flat fee of up to 900 euros supporting travel and visa costs is paid to each laureate. Its amount depends on the country of origin of the candidate. <br>Laureates will receive their scholarship as well as travel expenses only upon arrival in France and once they have registered in the program to which they have been admitted. <strong>No advance payment can be made. </strong><br>Laureates are supported in their administrative procedures and for the search of accommodation. However, <strong>the reservation of accommodation cannot be guaranteed </strong>and it is of laureates’ responsibility to anticipate the search for housing. <br> </p>",
