        "evidence_text": "and preferences.</p><p><a href=\"https://studyinsweden.se/scholarships\">Study in Sweden</a>&nbsp;</p></div></div><div data-accordion=\"\" id=\"P223375\" class=\"paragraph paragraph--type--accordion paragraph--view-mode--default\"><h2 class=\"paragraph-heading linked\"> Student loans</h2><div class=\"paragraph paragraph--type--accordion-item paragraph--view-mode--default\" data-accordion-item=\"\"> <button data-accordion-item-title><h3> Deferment of student loans, USA</h3> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" > <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.293 7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0L10 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 010-1.414z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" /> </svg> </button><div data-accordion-item-content class=\"accordion-item-hidden\"><div class=\"paragraph--text-image__text\"><p>Karolinska Institutet has been granted 'Deferment Only' status by the US Department of Education. This status means that US students may defer making payments on existing federal student loans while enrolled at Karolinska Institutet.</p><p>You submit an In-School Deferment request <a href=\"https://studentaid.gov/manage-loans/lower-payments/get-temporary-relief/deferment/in-school\">form</a> to Karolinska Institutet. After our certification, you submit the form to your servicer.</p><p>For more information, please contact <a href=\"mailto:tuitionfees@ki.se\">tuitionfees@ki.se</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p></div></div></div><div class=\"paragraph paragraph--type--accordion-item paragraph--view-mode--default\" data-accordion-item=\"\"> <button data-accordion-item-title><h3> Student Aid, Canada</h3> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" > <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.293 7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0L10 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 010-1.414z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" /> </svg> </button><div data-accordion-item-content class=\"accordion-item-hidden\"><div class=\"paragraph--text-image__text\"><p><strong>Alberta Student Aid</strong></p><p>Karolinska Institutet is designated by Alberta Student Aid. To learn more about the requirements and the application process, please see <a href=\"https://studentaid.alberta.ca/apply/\">Apply | Alberta Student Aid</a>.</p><p><strong>Manitoba Student Aid</strong></p><p>Karolinska Institutet is designated by Manitoba Student Aid. To learn more about the requirements and the application process, please see <a href=\"https://www.edu.gov.mb.ca/msa/\">Manitoba Student Aid | Province of Manitoba</a></p><p><strong>Ontario Student Assistance Program (OSAP).</strong></p><p>Karolinska is approved for the following cycles in the Ontario Student Assistance Program (OSAP).</p><ul><li>2024-25 OSAP</li><li>2025-26 OSAP</li></ul><p>To learn more about the requirements and the application process, please see <a href=\"https://www.ontario.ca/page/how-apply-osap\">How to apply for OSAP</a>.</p><p><strong>Student Aid British Colombia&nbsp;</strong></p><p>Karolinska Institutet is a designated institution for British Columbia student loans.&nbsp;</p><p>You apply online through <a href=\"https://studentaidbc.ca/apply/how-to-apply\">StudentAid BC Dashboard</a>. Before your student loan can be released, Karolinska Institutet must confirm that you are enrolled in the confirmation of enrolment form.</p><p>For more information about Canadian student aid, please contact <a href=\"mailto:tuitionfees@ki.se\">tuitionfees@ki.se</a></p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"paragraph documents\" id=\"P938\"><h2 class=\"linked\"> Documents</h2> <article><div class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\"> <a href=\"https://education.ki.se/media/52055/download\">Tuition fees and scholarship regulations at KI.pdf </a> <span>(PDF, 120.29 KB)</span></div> </article></div><div class=\"paragraph paragraph--type--contact-card contact-card without-image\" id=\"P223479\"><h2 class=\"paragraph-heading linked\">Contact</h2><div class=\"inner\"><div class=\"contact-card__wrapper\"><div class=\"contact-card__top-section\"><h3 class=\"contact-card__name\">Tuition Fee Team</h3> <span class=\"contact-card__name-title\"></span></div><div class=\"contact-card__mid-section\"><p><a href=\"https://education.ki.se/bachelors-masters-studies/tuition-fees#heading-4\" data-entity-type=\"external\">Contact the Tuition Fee Team</a></p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"paragraph paragraph--type--contact-card contact-card without-image\" id=\"P228898\"><div class=\"inner\"><div class=\"contact-card__wrapper\"><div class=\"contact-card__top-section\"><h3 class=\"contact-card__name\">International Admissions Team</h3> <span class=\"contact-card__name-title\"></span></div><div class=\"contact-card__mid-section\"><p><a href=\"https://education.ki.se/bachelors-masters-studies/apply/contact-admissions\">Contact the International Admissions Team</a></p></div></div></div></div></div> <footer class=\"for-main-content\"><div id=\"webform-submission-feedback-node-438-form-ajax-content\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div id=\"webform-submission-feedback-node-438-form-ajax\" class=\"webform-ajax-form-wrapper\" data-effect=\"fade\" data-progress-type=\"throbber\"><form class=\"webform-submission-form webform-submission-add-form webform-submission-feedback-form webform-submission-feedback-add-form webform-submission-feedback-node-438-form webform-submission-feedback-node-438-add-form js-webform-details-toggle webform-details-toggle antibot feedback-form\" data-drupal-selector=\"webform-submission-feedback-node-438-add-form\" data-action=\"/scholarships\" action=\"/antibot\" method=\"post\" id=\"webform-submission-feedback-node-438-add-form\" accept-charset=\"UTF-8\"> <noscript><div class=\"antibot-no-js antibot-message antibot-message-warning\">You must have JavaScript enabled to use this form.</div></noscript><div class=\"js-webform-type-radios webform-type-radios js-form-item form-item js-form-type-radios form-item-helpful