          "citizenship_residency": "Be a citizen or permanent resident of a country that has diplomatic relations with Japan. (Taiwan and Palestine are treated in this manner.)",
          "international_eligibility": "Explicit: open to overseas researchers invited by a host researcher in Japan; the candidate cannot apply directly",
