          "description": "JSPS Invitational Fellowships for Research in Japan bring overseas researchers to Japan for collaborative research through a host researcher in Japan, in Long-term (2 to 10 months) and Short-term (14 to 60 days) tracks. For FY2027 the 1st round deadline for host institutions was 28 August 2026 at 5 p.m. JST, with results in late December 2026. Support is a JPY 387,600 monthly or JPY 18,000 daily maintenance allowance plus economy airfare, travel insurance and up to JPY 150,000 research support.",
