          "subject_or_agency_requirement": "Restricted to applied monetary economics, macroeconomics, macroeconomic policy, public finance or public finance policy. Applicants are encouraged to reflect on the collaborative and multidisciplinary environment at NIAS and on how their research would benefit from and contribute to the NIAS research community. A residency at NIAS is a full-time commitment.",
