              "message": "Parallel submission to an ERC Starting Grant is allowed, but double funding for thematically similar projects is not."
            }
          ],
          "submission_workflow": [
            "Check your eligibility window, career stage and Swiss link",
            "Secure a host institution willing to sign the 2026 confirmation letter",
            "Use the SNSF portal CV tool to build your CV and confirm your net academic age",
            "Write the research plan",
            "Build the funding request within the CHF 1 million five-year cap and decide whether to request your salary",
            "Obtain the signed confirmation letter from the host institution",
            "Submit the complete application through the SNSF portal before 5 May 2026 17:00 CEST",
            "Await phase 1 results at the end of September 2026 and, if shortlisted, prepare for phase 2 interviews",
            "Plan a project start between 1 May 2027 and 1 May 2028"
          ]
