          "status": "CLOSED",
          "status_note": "'The 4th call is closed, let's look at the results.' and 'No call for proposals will be opened in 2023 and 2024.' appear against Institutional cooperation, Mobility, Vocational education and Inclusive education projects alike, and the Calls section repeats 'The 4th call for proposals for Institutional cooperation projects is closed ... No call for proposals will be opened in 2022 and 2023.' The last published deadline, 16/2/2022 15:00 CET, has long passed and no successor call is announced. Note the page is internally inconsistent, also stating 'We are currently preparing the fourth programme period of the Education Programme for 2021-2028', while simultaneously reporting the fourth call closed.",
