          "international_eligibility": "Not an individual scholarship. The counterparty side is open to institutions and organisations from the donor states (Norway, Iceland and Liechtenstein), with third-country EEA Grants beneficiaries allowed to participate without entitlement to financial support, and Swiss institutions eligible in specific mobility cases.",
