          "application_method": "A multi-step online process: read the Call for Proposals and the Guide for Applicants for eligible applicants, partners, activities and eligible expenditure; the Czech institution registers the project application in the online system at eea-app.dzs.cz, with partners given access if needed; the applicant fills in the application and uploads all required annexes using the published Letter of Intent, Work Programme and External Consultant templates; then 'A legal representative of the applicant institution or a person duly authorised by the legal representative must sign the application using the qualified certificate for electronic signature. The application can be signed and submitted only electronically through the on-line system.' First-time registrants need a qualified certificate for electronic signature.",
