          "selection_criteria": [
            "Projects should strengthen internationalisation and cooperation between partner institutions and should have an impact on teaching, applying new teaching methods and procedures that better respond to the needs of students and pupils",
            "'Projects focusing on democracy, active citizenship and inclusive education will be given priority in the selection process'",
            "For mobility projects, 'Priority points in the approval process will be awarded to projects organising placements for university students preparing for a teaching career, and pupils/students with special needs or from socially disadvantaged backgrounds'",
