          },
          "description": "EEA Grants - Projects and grants is the official DZS page for the Education Programme under the EEA and Norway Grants, which fund cooperation between Czech institutions and those in Norway, Iceland and Liechtenstein across four project types: institutional cooperation, mobility, vocational education and inclusive education. Applicants are Czech schools, higher education institutions holding an ECHE and specified public bodies, not individuals, and applications are submitted electronically through the DZS system with a qualified electronic signature. All calls are closed and the last published deadline was 16 February 2022 at 15:00 CET.",
