          "description": "The KU Leuven Inspiring the Outstanding Scholarship is a merit-based scholarship for students of all nationalities applying to a KU Leuven master's programme, restricted to those whose previous degrees were obtained outside Flanders and who are not already enrolled at a Flemish institution. It combines a full tuition fee waiver with an allowance of EUR 13,200 per academic year for a maximum of two academic years, and requires both a complete master's application file including the Candidacy Form and a separate online scholarship registration by 15 January 2026 at 23.59 CET. Nominees are then interviewed by video and ranked by a central KU Leuven Selection Committee.",
