          "subject_or_agency_requirement": "Applicants must be admitted to a UCAS school or a CAS institute, referred by a professor there, and the award is attached to that host. The announcement directs applicants to refer to the Calls for 2026 Master's Degree Programs, the Calls for 2026 Doctoral Degree Programs, and the Call for Visiting Students for the full programme requirements.",
          "application_method": "'Log in the UCAS Online Admission System for International Students (https://is.ucas.ac.cn/#/login) and choose the 'UCAS Scholarship for International Students' when you apply for a programme. Please note that no late application will be accepted.' The page also links the 'Procedure of Scholarship Application' page and instructs applicants to check the system email for the call and follow the link.",
