          },
          "description": "The UCAS Scholarship for International Students offers non-Chinese students funding to study at the University of Chinese Academy of Sciences or a CAS institute. The Full Scholarship bundles a tuition waiver (PhD RMB 40,000/year, Master's RMB 30,000/year), a monthly stipend (PhD RMB 2,500, Master's RMB 2,000, topped up by host assistantship to at least RMB 3,500 and RMB 3,000 respectively), basic accommodation, RMB 800/year medical insurance and a RMB 600 application fee waiver, for up to 36 months without extension; a Partial Scholarship covers tuition, insurance and the fee waiver only. PhD and Master's applications closed on 31 January 2026, while visiting student categories are open-ended.",
