          "research_requirement": "not required",
          "subject_or_agency_requirement": "The award targets candidates whose profile and projects have a significant link with the priorities of the scheme: economics, management, political science, humanities, law, education, sustainable development, research, innovation and technology, development, geopolitics, digital transition, health and sciences, etc. Health and sciences are at the heart of the France 2030 investment plan.",
          "application_method": "The scholarship cannot be applied for directly. You must be nominated by a French institution (universities, grandes écoles or comparable institutions) that submits the application to Campus France through the online platform. Each institution is responsible for selecting its candidates. Applications are shortlisted, assessed and ranked by the institution, which creates a master list of excellence of up to three candidates per scheme and discipline.",
