          },
          "description": "The Mannagetta Fellowships, financed from the Johann Wilhelm Ritter von Mannagetta Foundation at the Austrian Academy of Sciences, support completion of a doctoral thesis in archaeology, history, art and music history, philosophy or law. They are open to young, highly qualified doctoral candidates who started a doctorate at an Austrian university within the last three years and need a further twelve months to finish. EUR 25,000 is awarded for twelve months, with one or two fellowships per year, and the 2026 submission deadline is 20 October 2026 at 2 p.m. CEST.",
