          "citizenship_residency": "Non-EU international students. The official page states: 'we offer a range of merit-based scholarships to students from a number of outside of the EU countries, in line with our strategic international priorities'. The China Scholarship Council joint scholarship is restricted to students with a Chinese passport.",
          "international_eligibility": "Explicit - the Global Scholarships programme is University of Galway's international non-EU scholarship programme designed to attract and support outstanding students from around the world.",
