          "duration": "Not stated as a single rule on the hub page. For the CSC joint PhD scholarship, the award runs alongside a full-time PhD starting September 2026, and the University of Galway CSC scholarship committee ranks candidates in priority order to allocate a limited number of tuition-fee waivers.",
