          "description": "Global Scholarships is the University of Galway's international non-EU scholarship programme, a range of merit-based scholarships for students from outside the EU designed to attract and support outstanding students from around the world. Scholarships are organised by college, with more than 280 awarded in the previous year, and each college publishes its own scholarships and deadlines for the 2026/2027 academic year. The parent page also sets out external routes including a China Scholarship Council joint PhD scholarship, Government of Ireland Education Scholarships and other external funding sources.",
