          "citizenship_residency": "\"Required Legal Status: Domestic / International.\" Domestic eligibility is Canadian citizenship, Permanent Resident, or Protected Person under subsection 95(2) of the Immigration and Refugee Protection Act, by the graduate unit's student deadline. International students on a temporary resident visa (student study permit) are eligible for a set number of OGS awards, with permits valid as of the graduate unit's OGS international application deadline.",
