          "selection_weighting": "Relevant experience and achievements up to 40%; Plan of Study up to 30%; academic assessment reports up to 30% (15% for each of the two letters). These are the criteria previously used by the Ontario Ministry of Colleges and Universities panel and updated by the SGS Awards Committee; graduate units may use the same or similar criteria and applicants must confirm variations with their unit.",
