        "description": "Fudan University's notice for the 2026 Chinese Government Scholarship under the University Program (also titled Chinese University Program on the webpage) covers master's and doctoral applicants who are non-Chinese citizens in good health, under 35 for master's and under 40 for doctoral study. The award exempts tuition, provides free on-campus accommodation or an accommodation subsidy, comprehensive medical insurance, and a living stipend of RMB 3,000 per month for master's and RMB 3,500 for doctoral students. Applications are made in two stages: online at www.campuschina.org under Program Category Type B with Fudan agency number 10246, then through the Fudan istudent application system with fund source set to \"Self-support\" and the scholarship application form uploaded.",
