            "eligibility: non-Chinese citizens, good health, under 35 for master's, under 40 for doctoral, no other Chinese government scholarship",
            "coverage: tuition exemption, free on-campus accommodation or accommodation subsidy, comprehensive medical insurance",
            "stipends: RMB 3,000 per month master's, RMB 3,500 per month doctoral",
            "application period 13 October 2025 to 10 December 2025",
