          "deadline_note": "UNESCO and the National Commissions share a single deadline of 26 May 2025 at midnight Paris time, and the endorsed candidate's online information sheet is due by the same moment. Because only National Commission-endorsed applications are accepted, the real institutional deadline for an individual applicant is earlier and depends entirely on their National Commission's own timetable.",
