          "subject_or_agency_requirement": "Restricted to the 30 proposed research projects and the fields of research determined by the Polish authorities, listed in Annexes III and IV; some projects and fields are limited to candidates from particular regions.",
          "application_method": "Five steps. Step 1: read Annex I (Terms and Conditions) and Annex IV (fields of research and project titles). Step 2: contact the National Commission for UNESCO of your country for the national application procedure. Step 3: prepare the application and supporting documents and submit them to your National Commission. Step 4: once your National Commission confirms endorsement and nomination, submit the application by email to agh.poland@unesco.org, copying uniune25@agh.edu.pl and Fellowships.Engineering@unesco.pl, and then complete the online information sheet. Individual applications sent directly to UNESCO are not accepted, and email applications are not accepted at Step 5 of the selection process.",
