          "deadline_note": "The programme runs on numbered rounds rather than a fixed annual date. Round 21 opened 3 November 2025, held an Industry Information Session on 10 November 2025, and closed 16 January 2026 at 11:59pm AEDT, with successful and unsuccessful notifications made from August 2026. For Round 22 the page states only that 'Applications for Australia Awards Fellowships Round 22 are expected to open in the final quarter of 2026' and publishes no closing date, so the recorded central date is the Round 21 deadline, the most recent precise one published.",
          "status": "UPCOMING",
          "status_note": "'Australia Awards Fellowships Round 21 is now closed for applications.' and 'Applications for Australia Awards Fellowships Round 22 are expected to open in the final quarter of 2026.' As of 1 October 2026 the Round 21 close date of 16 January 2026 has passed and Round 22 has not yet opened, so the next window is imminent but not yet open.",
          "funding_amount": 34500,
