          "tuition_coverage_note": "The programme page does not describe tuition. Australia Awards Fellowships are professional development placements with an Australian Host Organisation rather than enrolment in a degree programme, and DFAT publishes only an aggregate 'Funding of up to $34,500 per Fellow' figure with no tuition line. No tuition claim is made.",
          "living_cost_coverage": null,
