            "Fellows must be able to complete the Fellow's Completion Survey at the conclusion of the Fellowship",
            "The Applicant Organisation must not exceed six applications and the application must not exceed 15 DFAT-funded Fellows"
          ],
          "supplements_or_initiatives": [
