            "china_scholarship_council": "http://www.campuschina.org"
          },
          "description": "The Chinese Government Scholarship for Advanced Graduate Program at Peking University (CSC Type B) is applied for twice: once in the Peking University International Student Service System and once in the China Scholarship Council system, where Peking University's institution code is 10001 and the application type is Type B. The award covers a full or partial tuition waiver plus a living stipend, housing and medical insurance, for 2-3 years at Master's level and 4-5 years at doctoral level. One Peking University application puts the applicant into evaluation for the CSC scholarship, the Peking University Scholarship and the Beijing Government Scholarship, with only one awarded.",
          "program_type": "Government scholarship administered by the China Scholarship Council and a host university (Type B)",
          "region": "China",
          "coverage": "Covers a full or partial tuition waiver, a living stipend, housing and medical insurance for 2-3 years (Master's) or 4-5 years (Doctoral); amounts are not itemised on the notice and the tuition waiver may be partial.",
