            "Download the Certificate for CSC Advanced Graduate Program Application from the PKU system from 25 February",
            "Choose exactly one major in the CSC system, because the award is evaluated on that major",
            "Use institution code 10001 and select Type B in the CSC system",
            "Prepare the Foreigner Physical Examination Statement and the signed No Criminal Record Self-Declaration if CSC items 11 and 12 do not apply to you",
            "Do not mail anything - the materials are submitted online only",
            "Keep scans of everything; you may be asked for supplementary material after submission"
          ],
          "common_rejection_risks": [
            "Missing the earlier Peking University deadline of 9 March and only making the CSC submission",
            "Submitting to the CSC but not the PKU system, or vice versa",
            "Selecting multiple majors in the CSC system, which allows only one",
