          "research_requirement": "required",
          "subject_or_agency_requirement": "The 20 places are used for recruiting students who go to China to study marine, medical, health, tourism, education and other required majors. Dispatched by the Embassy of the People's Republic of China in the Republic of Indonesia, with the embassy sending all recommended applications to the China Scholarship Council for final review.",
          "application_method": "Applicants check www.campuschina.org for information about Chinese universities and scholarship programs, contact their preferred Chinese universities and obtain Pre-Admission Documents, then submit the online application using Indonesian Agency Number 3602. \"There is no need to send paper materials to the embassy.\" From 9 February to 5 March 2026 the embassy sends all recommended applications to the China Scholarship Council for final review. From July to August 2026 applicants check admission results in the system themselves; the embassy notifies winners to download the admission notice and JW201 visa form from the system.",
