            "Meet the admission requirements of the applied university in academic ability and language proficiency"
          ],
          "documents": [
            "Application Form for Chinese Government Scholarship (in Chinese or English)",
            "Passport Home Page: clear scanned copy of the information page of an ordinary passport; if the currently held passport has less than 12 months validity calculated from the expected start date of study, it must be renewed",
            "Notarized highest diploma; prospective diploma winners must submit official proof of student status from their current school",
            "Academic transcripts",
            "Language qualification certificates: valid HSK score report for Chinese-taught master's, doctoral, general scholar and senior scholar programs, or relevant certificates such as IELTS or TOEFL for programs taught in other languages, in accordance with each university's requirements",
            "CSCA Score Report for bachelor's applicants",
