            "A Study Plan or Research Proposal in Chinese or English: minimum 200 words for undergraduates, 500 words for non-degree students, 800 words for postgraduates",
            "Recommendation letters: two letters in Chinese or English from professors or associate professors, for graduate or senior scholar programs",
            "Example of Art / Other Supporting Documents for art or design related majors, optional",
