            "Photocopy of the completed English-language Foreigner Physical Examination Form for anyone planning to stay in China for more than 6 months; incomplete records, or those without the attending physician's signature, the official hospital stamp, or a sealed photograph of the applicant are invalid, and the result is valid for only 6 months",
