          "application_method": "Researchers and scientists meeting the eligibility criteria apply using the prescribed format, downloadable from www.dst.gov.in, to the respective implementing agency in their partner country (if available) or to INSA, New Delhi. Where no implementing agency exists in the partner country, applications may be submitted as a hard copy or a scan copy with supporting documents to INSA. Hard copy to: The Executive Director, Indian National Science Academy (INSA), Bahadur Shah Zafar Marg, New Delhi-110002. Soft copy to: isrf.dst@insa.nic.in.",
