          "application_method": "\"Applications for scholarship are not accepted by email. Always apply for a scholarship at the same time as you apply for admission on the online application portal.\" Upload your CV/resume and a scholarship application letter (maximum one page, outlining why you should be considered) combined into one PDF file, and upload it to the section marked 'Scholarship' in the online application for admission. The scholarship application is only considered if a complete application for admission has been submitted. Only the scholarship application and documentation submitted at the time of application for admission are considered; no additional documentation is accepted once the application is submitted.",
