            "funding_amount as a single figure: the page states 'Amount: Variable' and 'Duration: Variable', and there are four different component values, so no one number is asserted",
            "living_cost_coverage and travel_coverage: neither is itemised in the program rules",
            "The Toolbox preselection submission guidance, whose link is unavailable"
          ],
