          "description": "SNSF Ambizione supports early-career researchers who want to lead an independent project at a Swiss higher education institution. Grants cover the grantee's salary plus the project funds needed, and run for a maximum of four years, with project starts between 1 September 2027 and 1 September 2028. Applicants may be from Switzerland or abroad provided they meet a four-year (nine-year for medical graduates) post-qualification window and a link with Switzerland. The Call 2026 opened 3 August 2026 and closes 3 November 2026 at 17:00 CET.",
