        "selection_notes": "Formal assessment criteria: Anders Programme</span></a><ul class=\"nav-child unstyled small\"><li class=\"item-3264 deeper parent\"><a href=\"/en/students/foreign-students/the-gen-anders-programme/calls-for-proposals-2026\" >Calls for proposals 2026</a><ul class=\"nav-child unstyled small\"><li class=\"item-3266 deeper parent\"><a href=\"/en/students/foreign-students/the-gen-anders-programme/calls-for-proposals-2026/bachelor-studies\" > <p>Formal assessment criteria:</p>",
        "program_type": "Pursuant to Article 19(1) of the Act of 7 July 2017 on the Polish National Agency for Academic Exchange, the Director of the Polish National Agency for Academic Exchange hereby announces as follows:",
